# Declarations in Go that write a key name, by the file and the name of the
# top-level declaration. TestNoKeysInGo fails on one this file doesn't
# list, and on a line that names none.
#
# One per line:
#
#   path:Name  keep: why the key is not configurable
#
# Every other key lives in default.yaml.

internal/tui/keys.go:forceQuit  keep: ctrl+c always quits, so that no config or capturing widget can trap the user
